{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>This is a DEMO version of Factory Reset</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you\u2019ll experience:<br>\u2013 \ud83d\udd27 1 of the 16 handcrafted levels<br>\u2013 \ud83c\udfae All core movement and platforming mechanics (jump, dash, climb, etc.)<br>\u2013 \ud83d\udc80 A preview of the unique death system<br>\u2013 \ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Voice-over implementation in key areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game will feature:<br>\u2013 \ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f 16 handcrafted levels<br>\u2013 \ud83d\udde3\ufe0f Full voice-over across all deaths and story events<br>\u2013 \ud83d\udc79 Boss fights<br>\u2013 \ud83d\udcd6 Complete story progression and difficulty settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is a <strong>vertical slice</strong> designed to give you a feel for the pacing, humor, and core gameplay of <strong>Factory Reset</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcac Your feedback is incredibly valuable and will help shape the final game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2764\ufe0f If you enjoy the demo, please consider <strong>wishlisting the full game</strong> on Steam:</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832590?t=1751032915","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832590/ebf18023d44affe34bee92e93f4de05de1807123/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751032915","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832590/584f8804033821d0ad15633897a5ca80d0780aa7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751032915","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832590/584f8804033821d0ad15633897a5ca80d0780aa7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751032915","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description